        <mxCell id="k" value="Why the loop matters: the third gate does not inspect the patch. It re-reconstructs the patched system and re-detects, so “9 → 0” is a measurement rather than a claim — and the LLM sits between two deterministic halves, with nothing it writes applied until a human has read it." style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;fontColor=#444444;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
