        <mxCell id="d8" value="Prerequisite, not part of the refactoring:
fix/container-base-images
openjdk:21-slim-buster was withdrawn from
Docker Hub → eclipse-temurin:21-jdk/:21-jre.
Until this, 'starts' could only SKIP." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="660" y="975" width="290" height="66" as="geometry"/>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d9" value="Every gate that can be confounded has a
CONTROL. 'smell' takes a baseline before
patching; 'starts' runs the UNPATCHED system
on failure. Without that control the gate
blamed a patch for a withdrawn base image.

A SKIPPED gate is not a PASSED one." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1">
